          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">If bone voids remain after bone fragment reduction, Pro-Dense may be injected into the defects that are not intrinsic to the stability of the skeletal system. The Pro-Dense paste cured in situ provides a void/gap filler that can augment the provisional hardware. The cured paste acts as a temporary support media and is not intended to provide structural support during the healing process.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
